ername": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "6. The director X was a well known perfectionist. He was one of the few to win Best Picture and Best Director Oscars for consecutive films. It can be derived from the two extreme stories below\n- For the movie Y (1962), the crew lived in the desert for nearly a year. He wouldn't let anyone walk on certain dunes for hours—or even days—because he needed the sand to be \"pristine\" and untouched by footprints for a single shot.\n- To create the \"Ice Palace\" for the movie Z (1965) during a 100°F (38°C) Spanish summer, the crew used tons of white marble dust and crushed limestone. To make the actors look cold, they were sprayed with water and then covered in wax and frost-colored crystals. The \"frozen\" landscapes in the background were actually huge sheets of plastic draped over the Spanish hills.\nId X, Y and Z.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:04Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Lean", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:11Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Lawrence of Arabia", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:16Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "zhivago", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Dr zhivago", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:18Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "dr", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:26Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Pavan 35 Anshula 10 Bijal 5 Sal 20", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-16T15:40:52Z", "username": "A", "text": "Is speed